{
    "en": {
        "BLAKE_RIFTER_NAME": "Rifter",
        "BLAKE_RIFTER_SUBTITLE": "The Fractured One",
        "PRIMARY_GAUNTLET_RANGED": "Focused Rift",
        "PRIMARY_GAUNTLET_RANGED_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Fracture</style>. Fire a long-range rift for <style=cIsDamage>500% damage</style>, applying up to 5 shatter. Hold the secondary skill to fire a mid-range rift for <style=cIsDamage>400% damage</style>.",
        "SECONDARY_FRACTURE": "Fracture Shot",
        "SECONDARY_FRACTURE_DESCRIPTION": "Fire piercing fracture shots for <style=cIsDamage>3 x 75% damage</style>.",
        "SECONDARY_FAULT_LINE": "Wandering Rift",
        "SECONDARY_FAULT_LINE_DESCRIPTION": "Throw a slow, dormant rift. It activates for <style=cIsDamage>300% damage</style> when another rift activates. On impact it explodes for <style=cIsDamage>700% damage</style> and applies 10 shatter. Cannot teleport.",
        "UTILITY_SLIPSTREAM": "Slipstream",
        "UTILITY_SLIPSTREAM_DESCRIPTION": "Teleport a short distance. Refreshes secondary skill stock.",
        "UTILITY_CHAINED_WORLDS": "Chained Worlds",
        "UTILITY_CHAINED_WORLDS_DESCRIPTION": "Shoot 5 rifts in a line, each dealing <style=cIsDamage>460% damage</style> and applying 5 shatter. Rifts <style=cIsUtility>teleport enemies to the next</style>; the last rift applies 10 shatter.",
        "UTILITY_QUANTUM_RIFT": "Quantum Portals",
        "UTILITY_QUANTUM_RIFT_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Fracture</style>. Dash back and create two portals, each dealing <style=cIsDamage>150% damage</style> per second. Portals <style=cIsUtility>teleport</style> to each other.",
        "SPECIAL_TIMELOCK": "Time Lock",
        "SPECIAL_TIMELOCK_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealth>Crushing</style>. Create a field that applies 10 shatter and draws rifts to itself. <style=cIsUtility>Hit it with a rift</style> to collapse Timelock for <style=cIsDamage>500% damage</style>.",
        "SPECIAL_RECURSION": "Recursion",
        "SPECIAL_RECURSION_DESCRIPTION": "Replicate a rift, causing it to echo again after a short period.",
        "PASSIVE_RIFT_BOOST": "Shatter",
        "PASSIVE_RIFT_BOOST_DESCRIPTION": "Slows by 10% and reduces armor by 5. Stacks linearly.",
        "PASSIVE_RIFT_FRACTURE": "Rift/Fracture",
        "PASSIVE_RIFT_FRACTURE_DESCRIPTION": "Rifts and fracture lines weaken the closer they are to Rifter.",
        "MASTERY_SKIN_NAME": "Survivalist",
        "BLAKE_NEM_RIFTER_NAME": "Nemesis Rifter",
        "BLAKE_NEM_RIFTER_SUBTITLE": "The Fractured One",
        "ACHIEVEMENT_BLAKE_RIFTER_BUCKSHOT_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "Rifter: tangling reality",
        "ACHIEVEMENT_BLAKE_RIFTER_BUCKSHOT_ACHIEVEMENT_DESCRIPTION": "Teleport 10 or more enemies at once!",
        "BLAKE_RIFTER_BUCKSHOT_ACHIEVEMENT": "Rifter: tangling reality",
        "BLAKE_RIFTER_WANDERING_RIFT_ACHIEVEMENT": "Rifter: Wandering Rift",
        "ACHIEVEMENT_BLAKE_RIFTER_WANDERING_RIFT_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "Rifter: Wandering Rift",
        "ACHIEVEMENT_BLAKE_RIFTER_WANDERING_RIFT_ACHIEVEMENT_DESCRIPTION": "Unlock Wandering Rift as Rifter.",
        "PRIMARY_BUCKSHOT": "Scattered Rifts",
        "PRIMARY_BUCKSHOT_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>Fracture</style>. Fire a rift for <style=cIsDamage>280% damage</style> that ripples for <style=cIsDamage>5 x 120% damage</style>. Applies 5 shatter. Hold the secondary skill to fire at mid-range.",
        "SPECIAL_RECURSION_SCEPTER": "To Singularity",
        "SPECIAL_RECURSION_DESCRIPTION_SCEPTER": "Position 10 stacked rifts, dealing <style=cIsDamage>350% damage</style> <style=cStack>(×120% per rift)</style>. Each rift is <style=cIsDamage>5% smaller</style> than the last.",
        "SPECIAL_CHAINED_WORLDS_SCEPTER": "Colliding Worlds",
        "SPECIAL_CHAINED_WORLDS_DESCRIPTION_SCEPTER": "Charge and fire 7 rifts in a line, dealing <style=cIsDamage>460% damage</style> <style=cStack>(×120% per rift)</style>. Rifts <style=cIsUtility>teleport enemies to the next</style>.",
        "BLAKE_RIFTER_LORE": "\"...Funny...\"\n\n\"Yeah. Real funny.\"\n\n\"It just... appeared?\"\n\n\"Well that's what they're sticking to, at least.\"\n\n\"Huh. Never imagined <i>we'd</i> be the ones they'd keep secrets from.\"\n\n\"I guess they can't have their Science Division knowing everything that comes their way.\"\n\nHannegan peered through the strange, glassy substance. He wanted to describe it as glass, but his need for concrete evidence got the better of him. He also wanted to tap it.\n\nHe tapped it.\n\nIt resonated in a very peculiar frequency, almost... like it was clipping in and out of time? He kept the thought in mind, but hesitated to draw conclusions from it.\n\n\"Hannegan, you know how much I hate it when you touch samples without permission.\"\n\n\"Permission to touch it?\"\n\n\"...Yes... It's not reactive to touch.\"\n\n\"Did they specify the material of this... glassy stuff?\"\n\n\"No. And it's not our point of interest.\"\n\nThe lead scientist, D.O. Harold Schmeuller, gestured toward the glassy substance, but not the substance itself. He pointed at what was <i>inside</i>.\n\n\"They say they've got readings of a crude, yet incomprehensibly advanced object which has the ability to teleport objects.\"\n\n\"You make that sound special. We've already worked out a way to teleport things. What's the difference?\"\n\n\"The intel I have been given suggests it appeared -- not just through space -- but through <i>time</i>.\"\n\n\"Time? That's impossi-\"\n\n\"Impossible, yes. Unless it isn't. Our task here is to find out how this thing teleports through time and space, and to replicate it. Project Rifter, is what they're calling it. Also, remember, Hannegan, we test weapons, <i>not</i> convenience items.",
        "UTILITY_PRESTIGE_SLIPSTREAM": "Prestige Slipstream",
        "BLAKE_NEM_RIFTER_DESCRIPTION": "Nemesis Rifter creates interdimensional pockets to amplify her damage.<color=#CCD3E0>\n\n< ! > Rifts are significantly stronger than fracture lines; positioning is key!\n\n< ! > Use the primary skill’s long- and mid-range options to vary your position.\n\n< ! > Some skills can teleport enemies, sometimes only under certain conditions. Use them to keep enemies at bay.\n\n< ! > Timelock can gather enemies so you can blast them all at once!\n\n</color>",
        "BLAKE_NEM_RIFTER_OUTRO_FLAVOR": "..and so she left a fractured world behind.",
        "BLAKE_NEM_RIFTER_OUTRO_FAILURE": "..and so she vanished from all realms.",
        "BLAKE_NEM_RIFTER_LORE": "\"...Funny...\"\n\n\"Yeah. Real funny.\"\n\n\"It just... appeared?\"\n\n\"Well that's what they're sticking to, at least.\"\n\n\"Huh. Never imagined <i>we'd</i> be the ones they'd keep secrets from.\"\n\n\"I guess they can't have their Science Division knowing everything that comes their way.\"\n\nHannegan peered through the strange, glassy substance. He wanted to describe it as glass, but his need for concrete evidence got the better of him. He also wanted to tap it.\n\nHe tapped it.\n\nIt resonated in a very peculiar frequency, almost... like it was clipping in and out of time? He kept the thought in mind, but hesitated to draw conclusions from it.\n\n\"Hannegan, you know how much I hate it when you touch samples without permission.\"\n\n\"Permission to touch it?\"\n\n\"...Yes... It's not reactive to touch.\"\n\n\"Did they specify the material of this... glassy stuff?\"\n\n\"No. And it's not our point of interest.\"\n\nThe lead scientist, D.O. Harold Schmeuller, gestured toward the glassy substance, but not the substance itself. He pointed at what was <i>inside</i>.\n\n\"They say they've got readings of a crude, yet incomprehensibly advanced object which has the ability to teleport objects.\"\n\n\"You make that sound special. We've already worked out a way to teleport things. What's the difference?\"\n\n\"The intel I have been given suggests it appeared -- not just through space -- but through <i>time</i>.\"\n\n\"Time? That's impossi-\"\n\n\"Impossible, yes. Unless it isn't. Our task here is to find out how this thing teleports through time and space, and to replicate it. Project NemRifter, is what they're calling it. Also, remember, Hannegan, we test weapons, <i>not</i> convenience items.",
        "<style=cKeywordName>Crushing</style><style=cSub>Damage increased by <style=cIsDamage>120%</style> per enemy hit.</style>": "<style=cKeywordName>Crushing</style><style=cSub>Damage increases by <style=cIsDamage>120%</style> per enemy hit.</style>",
        "<style=cKeywordName>Fracture</style><style=cSub>Fracture lines deal <style=cIsDamage>170%</style> damage. Weakens the closer it is to Rifter. <style=cIsHealth>Unable to crit</style>.</style>": "<style=cKeywordName>Fracture</style><style=cSub>Fracture lines deal <style=cIsDamage>170%</style> damage. They weaken closer to Rifter and <style=cIsHealth>cannot crit</style>.</style>",
        "BLAKE_NEM_RIFTER_PRIMARY_NEM_FRACTURE": "Reality Fracture",
        "BLAKE_NEM_RIFTER_MASTERY_SKIN_NAME": "Survivalist",
        "BLAKE_NEM_RIFTER_SECONDARY_FRACTURE": "Fracture Shot",
        "BLAKE_NEM_RIFTER_UTILITY_SLIPSTREAM": "Slipstream",
        "BLAKE_NEM_RIFTER_UTILITY_PRESTIGE_SLIPSTREAM": "Prestige Slipstream",
        "BLAKE_NEM_RIFTER_UTILITY_SLIPSTREAM_DESCRIPTION": "Teleport a short distance. Refreshes secondary skill stock.",
        "BLAKE_NEM_RIFTER_SPECIAL_TIMELOCK": "Time Lock",
        "BLAKE_NEM_RIFTER_SPECIAL_TIMELOCK_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealth>Crushing</style>. Create a field that applies 10 shatter and draws rifts to itself. <style=cIsUtility>Hit it with a rift</style> to collapse Timelock for <style=cIsDamage>500% damage</style>.",
        "ACHIEVEMENT_BLAKE_RIFTER_MASTERYACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "Rifter: Mastery",
        "ACHIEVEMENT_BLAKE_RIFTER_MASTERYACHIEVEMENT_DESCRIPTION": "As Rifter, beat the game or obliterate on Monsoon.",
        "BLAKE_NEM_RIFTER_PRIMARY_NEM_FRACTURE_DESCRIPTION": "Fire for <style=cIsDamage>320% damage</style>. Hold to keep firing; release to fire several projectiles sharing <style=cIsDamage>320% total damage</style>.",
        "BLAKE_NEM_RIFTER_SECONDARY_FRACTURE_DESCRIPTION": "Fire 3 piercing fracture shots."
